# DuetOS packages, added on top of archiso's releng list (which already has the kernel,
# linux-firmware, intel-ucode, btrfs-progs, dosfstools, gptfdisk, rsync, arch-install-scripts).
# Anything missing from the official repos is built from the AUR only if build-iso.sh allows it.

# --- Hardware enablement ---
linux-firmware
sof-firmware
alsa-ucm-conf
alsa-utils
intel-media-driver
libva-intel-driver
libva-utils
mesa
vulkan-intel
iio-sensor-proxy
evtest
upower

# --- Audio ---
